      "text": "2, and the concatenated quantized latent q\u2113= [e1,\u03ba\u2113,1; . . . ; eP,\u03ba\u2113,P ],\nwhere \u03ba\u2113,j is the discrete code index for timestep \u2113and product subspace j, and q\u2113is the concatenated\nquantized latent. A temporal convolutional decoder takes quantized sequence q = [q1, . . . , qT \u2032] and\nreconstructs \u02dcz = D(q). We optimize the tokenizer with a reconstruction and commitment objective:\n",
